- **Similarity scan first tripped at 0.044**, on "runs a standing audit on their own conduct" shared with caitlin-clark and "the strongest case against is Type X" shared with Ryan-Holiday. Both rewritten; now clear. The Type 1 pillar vocabulary (inner critic, inner courtroom, impossible standards) is 70%-saturated across T1 drafts, so the page runs entirely on Marcus's own words instead.
- **Ryan Holiday cross-link is deferred, not skipped.** `ryan-holiday` is `link: false` in famousTypes.ts, so an inline link would render dead. He's in `suggestions` only, with a reviewer note telling production to add the body link once that page ships.

